750 0 obj
<<
/Title (Unlike passwords or stored keys, a Physically Unclonable Function \(PUF\) generates a unique hardware fingerprint from microscopic manufacturing variations, making each FPGA inherently distinguishable.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 666 0 R
